// Title: Disable Important Scheduled Task
// ID: 9ac94dc8-9042-493c-ba45-3b5e7c86b980
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: frack113, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), X__Junior
// Date: 2021-12-26
// Tags: attack.impact, attack.t1489
// Description: Detects when adversaries stop services or processes by disabling their respective scheduled tasks in order to conduct data destructive activities
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_/disable*" or process.command_line like "*_-disable*")) and ((process.command_line like "*_\\Windows\\BitLocker*" or process.command_line like "*_\\Windows\\ExploitGuard*" or process.command_line like "*_\\Windows\\ExploitGuard\\ExploitGuard MDM policy Refresh*" or process.command_line like "*_\\Windows\\SystemRestore\\SR*" or process.command_line like "*_\\Windows\\UpdateOrchestrator\\*" or process.command_line like "*_\\Windows\\Windows Defender\\*" or process.command_line like "*_\\Windows\\WindowsBackup\\*" or process.command_line like "*_\\Windows\\WindowsUpdate\\*")) and ((process.executable endswith "\\schtasks.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "schtasks.exe")))
